<title>USA: Ross Stores sees Q3 EPS $0.62-$0.64.</title>
<headline>Ross Stores sees Q3 EPS $0.62-$0.64.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Calif. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Stores Inc expects to report record earnings per share of $0.62 to $0.64 for the third quarter ended November 2, almost double the $0.32 earned in the year-ago period, ended October 28, 1995, Chief Executive Officer Michael Balmuth said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He said stronger than planned momentum in August and September continued through October, which is contributing to record levels of same-store sales and earnings for the third quarter.</p>
</text>
